# Hash-verified Fuji replay data must reach every clone byte-for-byte.
#
# The viewer (src/replay/dataLoader.ts) and scripts/quality/verify-fuji-gps-handoff.py
# compare the SHA-256 of these files with the values recorded when the GPS
# registration was fitted. End-of-line conversion (core.autocrlf) changes the bytes,
# so a fresh clone would report every registration as stale and fall back to raw GPS.
# "-text" stores and checks out the files exactly as generated on every platform.
# Check with: python scripts/quality/check-fuji-hash-portability.py
public/data/races/fuji_aim_01/*.json -text
public/data/races/fuji_aim_2020_07_30/*.json -text
public/data/tracks/fuji/track.json -text
public/data/tracks/fuji/cg_study/*.json -text
public/data/vehicles/*.json -text
